      "content": "thanks for that. regarding the stone, you mentioned etching and scratching. how bad is it usually? like, if people are wearing hard-soled shoes or carrying heavy equipment, are we going to see visible damage pretty quickly or is it more of a gradual thing? also any specific types of stone you'd recommend that are harder?",
